Survivors include her children, John P. (Linda) Weber of Clearwater, Vicki (Ronald) Kress of Clearwater, and Jim (Linda) Weber of Clearwater; grandchildren, Glenn (Sandy) Weber, Kelly (Michael) Krouska, Kathy (Brian) Zarza, and Ryan Weber; 16 great grandchildren and three great great grandchildren.
She was preceded in death by her parents; her husband Jack Weber; two sons, Duane F. and Robert S. Weber; one granddaughter, Samantha Weber; a grandson, Jason Weber;

